  "prefLabel": "Omb 405.04 Complaint Follow-up Visits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Omb 405.04 Complaint Follow-up Visits. The LTCO or LTCOR shall make follow-up visits to the facility where the complaint arose as necessary to help ensure that the complaint remains resolved to the resident’s satisfaction.\n\nSource. #12379, eff 9-13-17",
